prompt:
A real photograph of a sunny beach on the Spanish coast in summer, late morning, taken as a friend sitting on the sand a few metres away would take it with a good phone camera, in a tall vertical picture, everything in sharp focus. Natural colours, bright Mediterranean light, a deep blue sky with a few small white clouds. The textures of real sand, water, foam, rock, cotton, straw, plastic and skin.

The first reference picture shows the young woman in three-quarter view, the second from the front: her face, her dark blonde hair tied back in a ponytail, her build and her height stay exactly as in them. Use them for the person only; her clothes here are a light-blue one-piece swimsuit, with a loose white linen shirt open over it.

Every thing on the beach stands on its own, with a little space around it, so that the eye can tell at once where each thing is. Nothing in the picture carries any writing: no signs, no labels, no print, no logos.

THE FRONT of the picture, the lower half, is warm pale sand:
- a large striped beach towel, blue and white, spread flat on the sand;
- on the towel, an open paperback book face down, a pair of sunglasses, a straw sun hat and a bottle of water with no label;
- next to the towel, a wicker beach bag with a rolled yellow towel sticking out of it;
- a little further, a red plastic bucket and a small blue spade lying in the sand beside a small sandcastle;
- a white seashell and a few small grey stones on the sand.

THE YOUNG WOMAN of the reference pictures sits on the towel, seen whole from her head to her bare feet, which rest on the sand with their shadow beside them, her knees drawn up. She is caught in the middle of eating an ice cream: she holds a cone with two scoops, one pink and one white, in one hand, and looks towards the sea with a wide, relaxed smile.

THE MIDDLE of the picture:
- the wet sand at the water's edge, with small white waves breaking on it;
- a boy of about eight in red swimming trunks plays at the water's edge with a big multicoloured beach ball, both feet in the shallow water;
- a large orange-and-white striped beach umbrella planted in the sand on the right, its shade on the sand, with a brown dog lying in the shade.

THE BACK of the picture:
- the calm blue sea up to the horizon;
- a white sailing boat with a white sail far out on the sea;
- on the right, a small rocky island with a white lighthouse on it;
- on the left, tall dark rocks at the end of the beach, with two white seagulls standing on them;
- above, the blue sky and the bright sun high in the corner, with a few small white clouds.
